                <page>
                    <exercise>
                        <statement>
                            <p>
                                Compute the derivative function of each function below using derivative rules.
State the rule name(s) that you used in each computation.
<ol>
    <li>
        <p>
            <m>f(x) = 3x^{5}+ x^{-3}+ 10</m>
        </p>
    </li>

    <li>
